            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Isilaeli mamwĩkaĩla Yeova: nũndũ Sisela aĩ na makasya ma kaũ maana kenda ma iaa; na nĩwathĩnasya ana ma Isilaeli na vinya myaka mĩongo ĩlĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
