          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na matavya Sisela kana Mbalaka mwana wa Avinoamu nĩwambatĩte kĩĩmanĩ kya Tavoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Sisela oomban’ya kuma Alosethi ya Andũ‐ma‐mbaĩ‐ingĩ, kũvika ũsĩnĩ wa Kisoni, makasya make onthe ma kaũ, o makasya maana kenda ma iaa, na andũ onthe ala maĩ vamwe nake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
