              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o Ngai wakĩlilye Yavini mũsumbĩ wa Kanaani vinya kwondũ wa ana ma Isilaeli mũthenya ũsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kw’oko kwa ana ma Isilaeli kwakĩlya Yavini mũsumbĩ wa Kanaani vinya mbee na mbee, mũvaka mamwananga Yavini mũsumbĩ wa Kanaani.",
          "type": "text",
